        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I find the default `equalalways` goes well together with it\n\nI forgot about 'equalalways', we should just use that to decide whether the default `VimResized` handler is activated. That makes this a very easy decision.\n\n> real improvement would be if all proportions would be preserved by default,\n\nDefinitely worth tracking as a separate enhancement.",
